{
  "openapi": "3.0.3",
  "info": {
    "title": "NanoOrbit API",
    "description": "API REST Flask pour le CubeSat Earth Observation System — Phase 5 (front-office consultation, back-office administration).\n\n**Niveau** : Autonome · **Auth** : Option A (connexion MySQL réelle).\n\n**Authentification** : le profil est détecté via `information_schema` après login. La session Flask conserve `username`, `password` et `role` (rôle applicatif).\n\n**Interface de test** : page statique sur `GET /` (`app/static/index.html`).\n\n**Profils et accès**\n| Compte login | Rôle app | Front-office | Back-office | Actions back |\n|--------------|----------|--------------|-------------|--------------|\n| `analyste_data` | `analyste` | Oui | Non | — |\n| `operateur_sat` | `operateur` | Oui | Partiel | BO-01, BO-02, BO-05 |\n| `resp_mission` | `responsable` | Oui | Partiel | BO-03 |\n| `admin_nano` | `admin` | Oui | Complet | Toutes |\n\n**Schéma Phase 2 (Groupe 14)** : tables `SATELLITE`, `FENETRE_COMM`, `EMBARQUE`, `PARTICIPE`, `INSTRUMENT` (PK `ref_instrument`), `STATION_SOL` (PK `code_station`), `MISSION`. Identifiants métier en `VARCHAR` (ex. `SAT-001`, `MSN-AMA-2023`, `IR-MID-01`).\n\n**Vues Phase 3** : `VUE_SATELLITES_OPERATIONNELS`, `VUE_BILAN_COMMUNICATIONS`, `VUE_TABLEAU_DE_BORD_MISSIONS`, `VUE_ALERTES_INSTRUMENTS`.\n\n**Procédure optionnelle Phase 4.5** : `desorbiter_satellite(id, @n)`.",
    "version": "1.1.0",
    "contact": {
      "name": "NanoOrbit — TP Bases de données"
    }
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "http://localhost:5000",
      "description": "Développement local (`python run.py`)"
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    { "name": "UI", "description": "Page de test statique (navigateur)" },
    { "name": "Auth", "description": "Connexion, session et profil utilisateur" },
    { "name": "Front-office", "description": "Consultation en lecture seule (FO-01 à FO-04, bonus FO-05)" },
    { "name": "Back-office — lecture", "description": "Données pour formulaires et listes d'administration" },
    { "name": "Back-office — écriture", "description": "Actions métier protégées par profil (BO-01 à BO-04, bonus BO-05)" }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["UI"],
        "summary": "Page de test HTML",
        "description": "Sert `app/static/index.html` — front-office (FO-01 à FO-05) et back-office (BO-01 à BO-05) avec authentification par cookie de session.",
        "operationId": "getTestUi",
        "security": [],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Document HTML",
            "content": {
              "text/html": {
                "schema": { "type": "string" }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/auth/login": {
      "post": {
        "tags": ["Auth"],
        "summary": "Connexion (Option A — MySQL)",
        "description": "Tente une connexion à `nanoOrbit_db` avec les identifiants saisis. En cas de succès, crée une session et détecte le rôle (`operateur`, `analyste`, `responsable`, `admin`) à partir du compte MySQL.\n\nRedirection applicative attendue :\n- `analyste` → front-office uniquement ;\n- `operateur`, `responsable`, `admin` → accès back-office selon droits Phase 4.",
        "operationId": "authLogin",
        "security": [],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LoginRequest" },
              "examples": {
                "analyste": {
                  "summary": "Analyste (front seul)",
                  "value": { "username": "analyste_data", "password": "********" }
                },
                "operateur": {
                  "summary": "Opérateur satellite",
                  "value": { "username": "operateur_sat", "password": "********" }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Connexion réussie",
            "headers": {
              "Set-Cookie": {
                "description": "Cookie de session Flask",
                "schema": { "type": "string" }
              }
            },
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AuthSession" }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Identifiants invalides ou connexion MySQL refusée",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error" },
                "example": { "error": "Identifiants invalides" }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/auth/logout": {
      "post": {
        "tags": ["Auth"],
        "summary": "Déconnexion",
        "operationId": "authLogout",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Session détruite",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": { "message": { "type": "string", "example": "Déconnecté" } }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/auth/me": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["Auth"],
        "summary": "Session courante",
        "description": "Retourne le profil connecté et les droits d'accès (front / back).",
        "operationId": "authMe",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Utilisateur authentifié",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AuthSession" }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Non authentifié",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error" }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/satellites": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["Front-office"],
        "summary": "FO-01 — Satellites opérationnels",
        "description": "Écran tableau de bord des satellites opérationnels.\n\n**SQL** : `SELECT * FROM VUE_SATELLITES_OPERATIONNELS`\n\nIndicateur visuel côté client selon le format (1U / 3U / 6U / 12U).",
        "operationId": "getSatellitesOperationnels",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Liste des satellites opérationnels",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SatelliteOperationnel" }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "500": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/InternalError" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/communications": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["Front-office"],
        "summary": "FO-02 — Bilan des communications par satellite",
        "description": "Bilan par satellite ; le satellite le plus actif est en tête de liste.\n\n**SQL** : `SELECT * FROM VUE_BILAN_COMMUNICATIONS ORDER BY volume_total DESC`",
        "operationId": "getBilanCommunications",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Bilan trié par volume total décroissant",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "items": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/BilanCommunication" }
                    },
                    "satellite_plus_actif": {
                      "description": "Premier élément (volume total max) — à mettre en évidence côté UI",
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/BilanCommunication"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "500": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/InternalError" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/missions": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["Front-office"],
        "summary": "FO-03 — Tableau de bord des missions",
        "description": "Missions actives avec indicateur « sous-dotée » si satellites opérationnels < participants.\n\n**SQL** : `SELECT * FROM VUE_TABLEAU_DE_BORD_MISSIONS`",
        "operationId": "getTableauBordMissions",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Missions actives",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MissionTableauBord" }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "500": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/InternalError" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/alertes": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["Front-office"],
        "summary": "FO-04 — Alertes instruments",
        "description": "Instruments en état dégradé ou hors service ; compteur d'alertes CRITIQUE en en-tête de page.\n\n**SQL** : `SELECT * FROM VUE_ALERTES_INSTRUMENTS ORDER BY priorite DESC`",
        "operationId": "getAlertesInstruments",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Liste des alertes et compteur critique",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "compteur_critique": {
                      "type": "integer",
                      "description": "Nombre d'alertes de priorité CRITIQUE"
                    },
                    "items": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AlerteInstrument" }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "500": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/InternalError" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/fenetres/historique": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["Front-office"],
        "summary": "FO-05 (bonus) — Historique des fenêtres de communication",
        "description": "Jointure `FENETRE_COMM` ↔ `SATELLITE` ↔ `STATION_SOL`. Tri par date de début décroissante.",
        "operationId": "getHistoriqueFenetres",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id_satellite",
            "in": "query",
            "schema": { "type": "string", "example": "SAT-001" },
            "description": "Filtrer par identifiant satellite (VARCHAR Phase 2)"
          },
          {
            "name": "statut",
            "in": "query",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": ["Réalisée", "Planifiée", "En cours", "Échouée"]
            },
            "description": "Filtrer par statut de la fenêtre"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Historique filtré",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/FenetreHistorique" }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "500": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/InternalError" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/back/satellites": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["Back-office — lecture"],
        "summary": "Liste satellites (tous statuts) — BO-01 / BO-04",
        "description": "Alimente les écrans de modification de statut et de désorbitation.\n\n**SQL** : `SELECT id_satellite, nom_satellite AS nom, statut FROM SATELLITE ORDER BY nom_satellite`",
        "operationId": "backListSatellites",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Satellites avec statut actuel",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SatelliteStatut" }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "403": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/ForbiddenBackOffice" },
          "500": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/InternalError" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/back/satellites/operationnels": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["Back-office — lecture"],
        "summary": "Satellites opérationnels (listes déroulantes)",
        "description": "Pour BO-02 (planifier fenêtre) et BO-03 (assignation mission).\n\n**SQL** : `SELECT id_satellite, nom_satellite AS nom FROM VUE_SATELLITES_OPERATIONNELS`",
        "operationId": "backListSatellitesOperationnels",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SatelliteRef" }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "403": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/ForbiddenBackOffice" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/back/stations/actives": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["Back-office — lecture"],
        "summary": "Stations au sol actives — BO-02",
        "description": "Liste déroulante des stations actives pour planification de fenêtre.\n\n**SQL** : `SELECT code_station AS id_station, nom_station AS nom FROM STATION_SOL WHERE statut = 'Active'`",
        "operationId": "backListStationsActives",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/StationRef" }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "403": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/ForbiddenBackOffice" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/back/missions/actives": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["Back-office — lecture"],
        "summary": "Missions actives (non terminées) — BO-03",
        "description": "Missions éligibles à une nouvelle participation.\n\n**SQL** : `SELECT id_mission, nom_mission AS nom, zone_geo_cible AS zone_cible FROM MISSION WHERE statut_mission = 'Active'`",
        "operationId": "backListMissionsActives",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MissionRef" }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "403": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/ForbiddenBackOffice" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/back/satellites/{id_satellite}/instruments": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["Back-office — lecture"],
        "summary": "BO-05 (bonus) — Instruments embarqués d'un satellite",
        "description": "Jointure `EMBARQUE` ↔ `INSTRUMENT`.\n\n**SQL** : `SELECT i.ref_instrument AS id_instrument, i.modele AS nom, i.type_instrument, e.etat_fonctionnement FROM EMBARQUE e JOIN INSTRUMENT i ON e.ref_instrument = i.ref_instrument WHERE e.id_satellite = ?`",
        "operationId": "backListInstrumentsSatellite",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id_satellite",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": { "type": "string", "example": "SAT-001" },
            "description": "Identifiant satellite (VARCHAR Phase 2)"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Instruments embarqués sur le satellite",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/InstrumentEmbarque" }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "403": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/ForbiddenBackOffice" },
          "500": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/InternalError" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/satellites/{id_satellite}/statut": {
      "post": {
        "tags": ["Back-office — écriture"],
        "summary": "BO-01 — Modifier le statut d'un satellite",
        "description": "Profils autorisés : `operateur_sat`, `admin_nano`.\n\n**SQL** : `UPDATE SATELLITE SET statut = ? WHERE id_satellite = ?`",
        "operationId": "updateSatelliteStatut",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id_satellite",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": { "type": "string", "example": "SAT-001" },
            "description": "Identifiant satellite (VARCHAR Phase 2)"
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/UpdateStatutRequest" }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Mise à jour confirmée",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SuccessMessage" },
                "example": { "message": "Statut du satellite mis à jour." }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Statut invalide ou satellite introuvable",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error" }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "403": {
            "description": "Profil non autorisé (ex. resp_mission, analyste_data)",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error" },
                "example": {
                  "error": "Action refusée : seuls operateur_sat et admin_nano peuvent modifier le statut d'un satellite."
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/InternalError" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/fenetres": {
      "post": {
        "tags": ["Back-office — écriture"],
        "summary": "BO-02 — Planifier une fenêtre de communication",
        "description": "Profils autorisés : `operateur_sat`, `admin_nano`.\n\n**SQL** : `INSERT INTO FENETRE_COMM (id_satellite, code_station, datetime_debut, duree, elevation_max, statut) VALUES (...)` — contrainte CHECK durée 1–900 s (Phase 2).",
        "operationId": "createFenetreCom",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CreateFenetreRequest" }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "Fenêtre planifiée",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "allOf": [
                    { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SuccessMessage" },
                    {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "id_fenetre": { "type": "integer" }
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Violation contrainte CHECK ou données invalides",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error" }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "403": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/ForbiddenAction" },
          "500": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/InternalError" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/participations": {
      "post": {
        "tags": ["Back-office — écriture"],
        "summary": "BO-03 — Assigner un satellite à une mission",
        "description": "Profils autorisés : `resp_mission`, `admin_nano`.\n\nVérifier `statut_mission <> 'Terminée'` et absence de doublon avant `INSERT INTO PARTICIPE (...)`.",
        "operationId": "createParticipation",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CreateParticipationRequest" }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "Participation créée",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SuccessMessage" }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Mission terminée, participation déjà existante ou données invalides",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error" },
                "examples": {
                  "mission_terminee": {
                    "value": { "error": "Impossible d'assigner : la mission est terminée." }
                  },
                  "doublon": {
                    "value": { "error": "Ce satellite participe déjà à cette mission." }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "403": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/ForbiddenAction" },
          "500": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/InternalError" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/satellites/{id_satellite}/desorbiter": {
      "post": {
        "tags": ["Back-office — écriture"],
        "summary": "BO-04 — Désorbiter un satellite",
        "description": "Profil autorisé : `admin_nano` uniquement.\n\n**Avec Phase 4.5** : `CALL desorbiter_satellite(?, @n); SELECT @n AS operations;`\n\n**Sans Phase 4.5** : `UPDATE SATELLITE SET statut = 'Désorbité' WHERE id_satellite = ?`\n\nConfirmation explicite côté client avant appel (`confirm: true`).",
        "operationId": "desorbiterSatellite",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id_satellite",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": { "type": "string", "example": "SAT-001" }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": ["confirm"],
                "properties": {
                  "confirm": {
                    "type": "boolean",
                    "description": "Doit être true après dialogue « Êtes-vous sûr ? »"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Satellite désorbité",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "message": { "type": "string" },
                    "fenetres_annulees": {
                      "type": "integer",
                      "description": "Retourné si procédure desorbiter_satellite() (Phase 4.5)"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Confirmation manquante ou satellite déjà désorbité",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error" }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "403": {
            "description": "Réservé à admin_nano",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error" },
                "example": {
                  "error": "Action refusée : seul admin_nano peut désorbiter un satellite."
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/InternalError" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/embarquements": {
      "post": {
        "tags": ["Back-office — écriture"],
        "summary": "BO-05 (bonus) — Ajouter un instrument sur un satellite",
        "description": "Profils : `operateur_sat`, `admin_nano`.\n\n**SQL** : `INSERT INTO EMBARQUE (id_satellite, ref_instrument, date_integration, etat_fonctionnement) VALUES (?, ?, CURDATE(), ?)`\n\nLe corps accepte `id_instrument` ou `ref_instrument` (alias vers `ref_instrument` Phase 2).",
        "operationId": "createEmbarquement",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CreateEmbarquementRequest" }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": { "description": "Instrument embarqué" },
          "400": {
            "description": "Instrument déjà sur un autre satellite",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error" }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/ForbiddenAction" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/embarquements/{id_satellite}/{id_instrument}": {
      "delete": {
        "tags": ["Back-office — écriture"],
        "summary": "BO-05 (bonus) — Retirer un instrument d'un satellite",
        "operationId": "deleteEmbarquement",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id_satellite",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": { "type": "string", "example": "SAT-001" },
            "description": "Identifiant satellite"
          },
          {
            "name": "id_instrument",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": { "type": "string", "example": "IR-MID-01" },
            "description": "Référence instrument (`ref_instrument` Phase 2, alias API `id_instrument`)"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Embarquement supprimé",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SuccessMessage" }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/BadRequest" },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "403": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/ForbiddenAction" }
        }
      },
      "patch": {
        "tags": ["Back-office — écriture"],
        "summary": "BO-05 (bonus) — Modifier l'état d'un instrument embarqué",
        "description": "**SQL** : `UPDATE EMBARQUE SET etat_fonctionnement = ? WHERE id_satellite = ? AND ref_instrument = ?`",
        "operationId": "updateEtatInstrument",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id_satellite",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": { "type": "string", "example": "SAT-001" }
          },
          {
            "name": "id_instrument",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": { "type": "string", "example": "IR-MID-01" }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": ["etat_fonctionnement"],
                "properties": {
                  "etat_fonctionnement": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": ["Nominal", "Dégradé", "Hors service"]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "État mis à jour",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SuccessMessage" }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/BadRequest" },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "403": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/ForbiddenAction" }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "sessionCookie": {
        "type": "apiKey",
        "in": "cookie",
        "name": "session",
        "description": "Session Flask signée (cookie). Obtenue via POST /api/auth/login."
      }
    },
    "responses": {
      "Unauthorized": {
        "description": "Session absente ou expirée",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error" },
            "example": { "error": "Non authentifié" }
          }
        }
      },
      "NotFound": {
        "description": "Route API introuvable",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error" },
            "example": { "error": "Route API introuvable." }
          }
        }
      },
      "BadRequest": {
        "description": "Données invalides ou contrainte métier violée",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error" }
          }
        }
      },
      "ForbiddenBackOffice": {
        "description": "Profil sans accès back-office (ex. analyste_data)",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error" },
            "example": { "error": "Accès back-office refusé pour votre profil." }
          }
        }
      },
      "ForbiddenAction": {
        "description": "Action métier non autorisée pour le profil connecté",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error" }
          }
        }
      },
      "InternalError": {
        "description": "Erreur serveur ou MySQL (message explicite, pas de stack trace en production)",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error" }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "Error": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["error"],
        "properties": {
          "error": { "type": "string" }
        }
      },
      "SuccessMessage": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "message": { "type": "string" }
        }
      },
      "LoginRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["username", "password"],
        "properties": {
          "username": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Compte MySQL Phase 4",
            "enum": [
              "analyste_data",
              "operateur_sat",
              "resp_mission",
              "admin_nano"
            ]
          },
          "password": { "type": "string", "format": "password" }
        }
      },
      "AuthSession": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "username": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Compte login Phase 4",
            "example": "operateur_sat"
          },
          "role": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["analyste", "operateur", "responsable", "admin"],
            "description": "Rôle applicatif dérivé du compte MySQL"
          },
          "can_access_backoffice": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "false pour analyste_data"
          },
          "access": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "front_office": { "type": "boolean", "example": true },
              "back_office": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "description": "false pour analyste_data"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "SatelliteRef": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id_satellite": { "type": "string", "example": "SAT-001" },
          "nom": { "type": "string", "example": "NanoOrbitAlpha" }
        }
      },
      "StationRef": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id_station": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Alias de code_station",
            "example": "GS-TLS-01"
          },
          "nom": { "type": "string", "example": "Toulouse-CNES" }
        }
      },
      "MissionRef": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id_mission": { "type": "string", "example": "MSN-AMA-2023" },
          "nom": { "type": "string", "example": "ForestWatch Amazonia" },
          "zone_cible": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Alias de zone_geo_cible",
            "example": "Amérique du Sud (-5N, 50O)"
          }
        }
      },
      "SatelliteOperationnel": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "Colonnes de VUE_SATELLITES_OPERATIONNELS (noms selon vue Phase 3)",
        "additionalProperties": true,
        "properties": {
          "id_satellite": { "type": "string", "example": "SAT-001" },
          "nom_satellite": { "type": "string", "example": "NanoOrbitAlpha" },
          "format_cubesat": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["1U", "3U", "6U", "12U"],
            "description": "Indicateur visuel côté UI"
          },
          "date_lancement": { "type": "string", "format": "date" },
          "type_orbite": { "type": "string", "example": "SSO" },
          "altitude": { "type": "integer", "example": 550 },
          "capacite_batterie": { "type": "number", "example": 60.0 }
        }
      },
      "BilanCommunication": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "VUE_BILAN_COMMUNICATIONS",
        "additionalProperties": true,
        "properties": {
          "id_satellite": { "type": "string", "example": "SAT-001" },
          "nom_satellite": { "type": "string" },
          "nb_fenetres": { "type": "integer" },
          "volume_total": { "type": "number" },
          "volume_moyen": { "type": "number" },
          "date_derniere_com": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" },
          "nb_stations": { "type": "integer" }
        }
      },
      "MissionTableauBord": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "VUE_TABLEAU_DE_BORD_MISSIONS (+ champ calculé sous_dotee)",
        "additionalProperties": true,
        "properties": {
          "id_mission": { "type": "string", "example": "MSN-AMA-2023" },
          "nom_mission": { "type": "string" },
          "zone_geo_cible": { "type": "string" },
          "date_debut": { "type": "string", "format": "date" },
          "nb_satellites": { "type": "integer" },
          "nb_sat_operationnels": { "type": "integer" },
          "sous_dotee": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "true si nb_sat_operationnels < nb_satellites"
          }
        }
      },
      "AlerteInstrument": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "VUE_ALERTES_INSTRUMENTS",
        "additionalProperties": true,
        "properties": {
          "ref_instrument": { "type": "string", "example": "IR-MID-01" },
          "nom_satellite": { "type": "string", "example": "NanoOrbitAlpha" },
          "statut_satellite": { "type": "string" },
          "type_instrument": { "type": "string" },
          "etat_fonctionnement": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["Dégradé", "Hors service"]
          },
          "priorite": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["CRITIQUE", "SURVEILLANCE"],
            "description": "CRITIQUE → rouge, SURVEILLANCE → orange"
          }
        }
      },
      "FenetreHistorique": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "FO-05 — jointure FENETRE_COMM / SATELLITE / STATION_SOL",
        "properties": {
          "id_fenetre": { "type": "integer" },
          "date_heure_debut": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" },
          "duree_secondes": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "maximum": 900 },
          "id_satellite": { "type": "string", "example": "SAT-001" },
          "nom_satellite": { "type": "string" },
          "id_station": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Alias de code_station",
            "example": "GS-TLS-01"
          },
          "nom_station": { "type": "string" },
          "elevation_max_deg": { "type": "number" },
          "volume_donnees_mo": { "type": "number", "nullable": true },
          "statut": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["Réalisée", "Planifiée", "En cours", "Échouée"]
          }
        }
      },
      "SatelliteStatut": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id_satellite": { "type": "string", "example": "SAT-001" },
          "nom": { "type": "string", "example": "NanoOrbitAlpha" },
          "statut": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["Opérationnel", "En veille", "Défaillant", "Désorbité"],
            "description": "BO-01 n'autorise que Opérationnel, En veille, Désorbité"
          }
        }
      },
      "UpdateStatutRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["statut"],
        "properties": {
          "statut": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["Opérationnel", "En veille", "Désorbité"]
          }
        }
      },
      "CreateFenetreRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "id_satellite",
          "id_station",
          "date_heure_debut",
          "duree_secondes",
          "elevation_max"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "id_satellite": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Satellite opérationnel",
            "example": "SAT-001"
          },
          "id_station": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Station au sol active (code_station)",
            "example": "GS-TLS-01"
          },
          "date_heure_debut": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Format `YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS`",
            "example": "2024-06-02 14:30:00"
          },
          "duree_secondes": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 900
          },
          "elevation_max": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "Élévation maximale (degrés)"
          },
          "statut": {
            "type": "string",
            "default": "Planifiée",
            "enum": ["Planifiée"]
          }
        }
      },
      "CreateParticipationRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["id_satellite", "id_mission", "role_satellite"],
        "properties": {
          "id_satellite": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Satellite opérationnel",
            "example": "SAT-004"
          },
          "id_mission": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Mission active (statut_mission = Active)",
            "example": "MSN-ARC-2023"
          },
          "role_satellite": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Rôle du satellite dans la mission",
            "example": "Satellite de relais"
          }
        }
      },
      "CreateEmbarquementRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["id_satellite"],
        "properties": {
          "id_satellite": { "type": "string", "example": "SAT-003" },
          "id_instrument": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Alias API de ref_instrument",
            "example": "CAM-HR-02"
          },
          "ref_instrument": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Référence instrument Phase 2 (prioritaire si les deux sont fournis)",
            "example": "CAM-HR-02"
          },
          "etat_fonctionnement": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["Nominal", "Dégradé", "Hors service"],
            "default": "Nominal"
          }
        },
        "anyOf": [
          { "required": ["id_instrument"] },
          { "required": ["ref_instrument"] }
        ]
      },
      "InstrumentEmbarque": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "ref_instrument et modele exposés sous id_instrument et nom",
        "properties": {
          "id_instrument": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Alias de ref_instrument",
            "example": "IR-MID-01"
          },
          "nom": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Alias de modele",
            "example": "ThermoSat IRv3"
          },
          "type_instrument": { "type": "string", "example": "Capteur IR" },
          "etat_fonctionnement": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["Nominal", "Dégradé", "Hors service"]
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "security": [{ "sessionCookie": [] }],
  "x-implementation-checklist": {
    "seance_1": [
      "POST /api/auth/login + session",
      "GET /api/auth/me",
      "GET /api/satellites (VUE_SATELLITES_OPERATIONNELS)",
      "GET / — page de test statique"
    ],
    "seance_2": [
      "GET /api/communications",
      "GET /api/missions",
      "GET /api/alertes"
    ],
    "seance_3": [
      "POST /api/satellites/{id}/statut",
      "POST /api/fenetres",
      "POST /api/participations",
      "POST /api/satellites/{id}/desorbiter",
      "Messages 403 explicites pour actions interdites"
    ],
    "bonus": [
      "GET /api/fenetres/historique",
      "BO-05 embarquements (EMBARQUE / ref_instrument)",
      "GET routes /api/back/* pour formulaires"
    ],
    "a_venir": [
      "GET /api/health",
      "GET /api/health/db"
    ]
  }
}
